FossilDig_Text_ReturnAsk::
	.string "Ready to go back to the dock?$"

FossilDig_Text_Stay::
	.string "Take your time. The tide can wait.$"

FossilDig_Text_Npc0::
	.string "Brush the sand with care. A fossil\n"
	.string "waits under the five spots that\p"
	.string "shine.$"

FossilDig_Text_Ghost1_Offer::
	.string "A ghost left this egg-shaped dream\n"
	.string "behind. Take care of a LARVITAR?$"

FossilDig_Text_Ghost1_Got::
	.string "Take good care of it.$"

FossilDig_Text_Ghost1_After::
	.string "It was a good home, in the end.$"

FossilDig_Text_Ghost1_Refuse::
	.string "Then I will wait a little longer.$"

